1
00:00:04,166 --> 00:00:04,958
Mayura!

2
00:00:05,958 --> 00:00:11,041
Kindaichi? Why did you ask
 me to come here at this hour?

3
00:00:13,083 --> 00:00:17,125
What? But your letter told me to come here!

4
00:00:17,416 --> 00:00:20,041
A letter from me? 
I know nothing about it.

5
00:00:21,166 --> 00:00:24,958
I got a letter from you asking me to come here.

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,416
The geyser's about to erupt!

7
00:00:32,708 --> 00:00:35,541
Huh? Now that you mention
it, I smell rotten eggs...

8
00:00:40,708 --> 00:00:41,291
It can't be!

9
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:49,333
The doll danced...
